'''Manic Flying Cat''' (大狂乱の天空のネコ, ''Dai Kyōran no Tenkū no Neko'', '''''Insane Sky Cat''''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy found in [[Forest Beasts (Deadly)|Forest Beasts]]. It was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

